*.tmp
*.bak
docs/ai/generated/
# END ai-kit
# Scratch review artifacts from AI review passes; not source.
.ai-review/

# graphify knowledge-graph output: regenerable local cache (graph.json alone is ~150MB,
# and the AST cache under graphify-out/cache/ holds thousands of per-file JSON blobs).
# Too large to commit/push; regenerate locally with `graphify update .` per docs/ai/... graphify
# instructions. Untracked from git history going forward via `git rm -r --cached graphify-out`.
graphify-out/
